Specification Mars Rover

DataType Heading
Description A compass direction indicating which way the rover is facing.
Examples: ValidValues
| Value | IsValid | Notes                             |
| N     | True    |                                   |
| E     | True    |                                   |
| S     | True    |                                   |
| W     | True    |                                   |
| NE    | False   | Only cardinal directions allowed. |
| X     | False   | Unknown heading.                  |
|       | False   | Heading is required.              |

DataType Commands
Description A sequence of rover commands.
Examples: ValidValues
| Value | IsValid | Notes                        |
| L     | True    | Turn left.                   |
| R     | True    | Turn right.                  |
| M     | True    | Move forward.                |
| LRM   | True    | Sequence of valid commands.  |
| MX    | False   | X is not a valid command.    |
| 123   | False   | Commands must be alphabetic. |

DataType Position
Description A rover location and heading.
Examples: ValidValues
| Value | IsValid | Notes                        |
| 0,0,N | True    |                              |
| 1,2,E | True    |                              |
| 9,9,S | True    |                              |
| 0,0   | False   | Heading is missing.          |
| N,0,0 | False   | Coordinates must be first.   |
| A,B,N | False   | Coordinates must be numeric. |

Attributes NavigationCases
| Name          | DataType |
| StartPosition | Position |
| Commands      | Commands |
| Result        | Position |
| Notes         | String   |

Calculation Navigate Rover
Description The rover follows commands from its starting position and reports its final position.
Examples: NavigationCases
| StartPosition | Commands | Result | Notes                  |
| 0,0,N         |          | 0,0,N  | No commands.           |
| 0,0,N         | M        | 0,1,N  | Move north.            |
| 0,0,E         | M        | 1,0,E  | Move east.             |
| 0,0,S         | M        | 0,-1,S | Move south.            |
| 0,0,W         | M        | -1,0,W | Move west.             |
| 0,0,N         | L        | 0,0,W  | Turn left from north.  |
| 0,0,N         | R        | 0,0,E  | Turn right from north. |
| 0,0,N         | RM       | 1,0,E  | Turn then move.        |